+  artifact, not a cost effect. This is the same null-dispersion sensitivity
+  documented for the longer-horizon momentum verdicts.
+
+UNVERIFIED
+- Whether the edge survives genuinely conservative (directionally adverse)
+  transaction costs. The existing engine cannot express sell-side adverse
